,\\text{d}t \\\\ \\frac{4}{3}(x+1)^{3/4} & =4t+{C}_{1} \\\\ (x+1)^{3/4} & =3t+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C=\\frac{3{C}_{1}}{4}.$ \n\nWe're given that $x=0$ when $t=0.$ Therefore, $C=1,$ and the particular solution is\n\n$$\n(x+1)^{3/4}=3t+1.\n$$\n\nFinally, writing $x$ in terms of $t,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(x+1)^{3/4} & =3t+1 \\\\ x+1 & =(3t+1)^{4/3} \\\\ x & =(3t+1)^{4/3}-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337981 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337982 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337983 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337984 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337985 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1041 "selection" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337982 13194139535214 true] [17592186337980 1110 #uuid "4ef253d5-3b28-532f-a890-10eb1ea362cc" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337981 1034 "x(t)=(3t+1)^{4}-1" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337981 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535214 true] [17592186337981 1111 #uuid "27fdafa4-f068-570e-a0c9-6545f8fdefe5" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337982 1034 "x(t)=(3t+1)^{4/3}-1" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337982 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535214 true] [17592186337982 1111 #uuid "053297e4-bfe0-5298-aa3a-d3833e327560" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337983 1034 "x(t)=(4t+1)^{3}-1" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337983 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535214 true] [17592186337983 1111 #uuid "048b1522-739c-563d-8e9b-4df9a9f1017a" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337984 1034 "x(t)=(t+2)^{2/3}-1" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337984 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535214 true] [17592186337984 1111 #uuid "99447f2d-715c-5ec3-91a6-d4ddb02cf267" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337985 1034 "x(t)=(t+2)^{4/3}" 13194139535214 true] [17592186337985 1103 #edb/ref 175921860454